# This controls which PayPal API (sandbox vs real-money live) the backend
# talks to — it must always match src/paypalSdk.ts's hardcoded Client ID
# (sandbox vs live) and the Secret Manager version PAYPAL_CLIENT_ID/
# PAYPAL_CLIENT_SECRET currently point to, or checkout will hang (frontend
# renders one environment's order, backend created it in the other). This
# project went live 2026-08-01 — set to "live" here to match. Only use
# "sandbox" for local/manual testing against test cards, and never deploy
# with "sandbox" while src/paypalSdk.ts still has the live Client ID.
PAYPAL_ENV=live
